  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of the MIP II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this project is to Formulate actions under the MIP II&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Overall objective&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The overall objective (Impact) to which this action contributes is:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;To design actions under priorities of the MIP&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Specific objective&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The specific objective (Outcome) of this contract is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective (Outcome) 1: study for the design of infrastructure in the south and at the western border which will be financed by the MIP II&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
